  "citation": "Tyler S C (2003): Mixing Ratios of CO, CO2, CH4, and Isotope Ratios of Associated 13C, 18O, and 2H in Air Samples from Niwot Ridge, Colorado, and Montana de Oro, California, USA (January 2004). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.DB1022",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
